\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Clean baseline (no adversaries) over 50 communication rounds. \textit  {Left:} AUC-ROC. \textit  {Right:} F1-Score. TRAP achieves the highest F1 (0.409) and a competitive AUC (0.702) vs.\ FedAvg (AUC=0.685, F1=0.396) and Krum (AUC=0.649, F1=0.301). Krum exhibits high variance due to the geometric neighbour selection being sensitive to non-IID gradient distributions.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
